SkeuoHLE
Source: https://github.com/skeuoHLE/SkeuoHLE

SkeuoHLE carries forward an early iPhone OS emulator and its Android
embedded-host interface. Upstream work includes HyperHLE-Reborn, HyperHLE,
touchHLE, and contributions by the respective projects' contributors:
https://github.com/KlugKlugTG/HyperHLE-Reborn
https://github.com/HyperHLE/HyperHLE
https://github.com/touchHLE/touchHLE

